1
00:00:00,160 --> 00:00:01,567
Baru aja gue kirim desain,

2
00:00:01,818 --> 00:00:02,882
klien langsung balas...

3
00:00:03,153 --> 00:00:05,143
Bagus sih... tapi kurang nendang!

4
00:00:05,422 --> 00:00:07,400
Lah?! Kurang nendang gimana, Bang?!

5
00:00:07,872 --> 00:00:09,143
Mau gue tendang posternya?!

6
00:00:09,444 --> 00:00:10,836
Awalnya minta minimalis.

7
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:12,589
Sekarang malah pengin lebih rame.

8
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:14,088
Gue sempet mikir...

9
00:00:14,497 --> 00:00:15,975
apa perlu nambah ornamen?

10
00:00:16,308 --> 00:00:18,062
Warna? Atau elemen lain?

11
00:00:18,423 --> 00:00:20,473
Waduh... bisa balik
berantakan lagi, nih.

12
00:00:20,737 --> 00:00:23,291
Tapi bentar... jangan-jangan
gue salah nangkep.

13
00:00:23,587 --> 00:00:26,756
Gue tanya balik, bagian mana
yang sebenarnya kurang menonjol?

14
00:00:27,008 --> 00:00:30,351
Eh, ternyata klien cuma takut
angka diskonnya nggak kelihatan!

15
00:00:30,627 --> 00:00:31,926
Oke, sekarang jelas!

16
00:00:32,133 --> 00:00:33,379
Gue gedein angka diskon,

17
00:00:33,645 --> 00:00:34,422
perkuat kontras,

18
00:00:34,646 --> 00:00:36,433
terus rapihin posisi
tombol ajakannya.

19
00:00:36,707 --> 00:00:38,878
Nah, sekarang fokus
desainnya lebih jelas.

20
00:00:39,170 --> 00:00:40,819
Nggak perlu nambah
elemen macem-macem.

21
00:00:41,033 --> 00:00:42,222
Gue kirim lagi ke klien.

22
00:00:42,471 --> 00:00:43,928
Nah, ini maksud saya!

23
00:00:44,186 --> 00:00:45,246
AKHIRNYAAA!

24
00:00:45,492 --> 00:00:47,020
Eh... dia chat lagi?

25
00:00:47,240 --> 00:00:48,344
Bisa final malam ini?

26
00:00:48,582 --> 00:00:49,938
HAH?! MALAM INI?!

27
00:00:50,174 --> 00:00:51,690
Waduh... episode enam,

28
00:00:51,889 --> 00:00:52,960
deadline tinggal sejam!
